# Deploy updates

When asked to commit updates, use this flow and stop after it succeeds.

1. Commit locally.
2. Push to GitHub.
3. SSH to Lightsail: `ssh -i ~/Downloads/LightsailDefaultKey-eu-west-2.pem admin@52.56.69.225`
4. On the instance, run:

```bash
cd /home/admin/portfolio
git pull origin master
GATE_PASSWORD="$(cat /home/admin/portfolio/.gate-secret)" npm run build
sudo pm2 restart portfolio-gate --update-env
```

`private/` is gitignored. Case-study HTML and images there are not in the commit. After the pull, copy changed files under `private/portfolio/` to the same path on the instance before the build.
